WEBVTT

00:02:29.255 --> 00:02:30.405
No matter.

00:02:30.906 --> 00:02:32.056
No matter.

00:02:32.874 --> 00:02:34.024
Right.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:35.855
Right, introductions.

00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:37.559
It's a TEDx talk. Right.

00:02:38.664 --> 00:02:41.332
Hi, there! (Laughs) Um.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:43.830
My name is Jo Michael Rezes,

00:02:43.854 --> 00:02:47.763
and I'm a PhD student here
in theater and performance studies.

00:02:48.347 --> 00:02:51.204
And I specialize in the study
of queer identities

00:02:51.228 --> 00:02:54.410
as they maneuver and affect
the perceptions of time

00:02:54.434 --> 00:02:56.234
in the performance of camp.

00:02:56.956 --> 00:02:58.700
You know camp?